{"id":"n58204-1-10","stage":1,"title":"배우 · 演员","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58204-1-10-1","ko":"유민아, 너는 장래 희망이 뭐야?","zh":"裕敏啊，你未来的理想是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"장래","meaning":"将来，未来","explanation":"장래：将来，未来。","readings":[{"term":"장래","audio":"/audio/3cdeff7f4cc656c6864b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70089","senseId":"1","lemma":"장래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장래","audio":"/audio/3cdeff7f4cc656c6864b.mp3"}},{"text":"희망이","meaning":"希望，愿望","explanation":"희망：希望，愿望；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"희망","audio":"/audio/86dd2817357de7312257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73256","senseId":"1","lemma":"희망","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"희망이","audio":"/audio/d463ac2e848705b9cbdb.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"3cdeff7f4cc656c6","term":"장래","zh":"将来，未来","audio":"/audio/3cdeff7f4cc656c6864b.mp3","entryId":"70089","definition":"即将到来的日子。","pronunciation":["장내"]},{"id":"86dd2817357de731","term":"희망","zh":"希望，愿望","audio":"/audio/86dd2817357de7312257.mp3","entryId":"73256","definition":"对未来抱有期望。","pronunciation":["히망"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b88f492f5fc79dc0bd9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58204-1-10-2","ko":"나는 커서 배우가 되고 싶어.","zh":"我长大后想成为一名演员。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"커서","meaning":"成长","explanation":"크다：成长；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커서","audio":"/audio/04ee3e2083318326b251.mp3"}},{"text":"배우가","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우가","audio":"/audio/71eed0fd360842635c34.mp3"}},{"text":"되고","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되고","audio":"/audio/73e51fe845fa66b6fb7d.mp3"}},{"text":"싶어.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origi